              <p>Skadi needs setup time before her loop activates. She must survive the opening exchange to begin stacking ATK from her Relic and generating Energy from Realm of Frost. Place her in position 4 or 5 - as far from enemy frontline threats as possible.</p>
              <p>Her Relic Lv2 pseudo-revival provides insurance, but burning it early to survive poor positioning wastes the DPS extension it provides in late-fight.</p>
