              <div class="rating-mode">Campaign / Push</div>
              <div class="rating-cell"><span class="rating-badge" data-tier="SS">SS</span></div>
              <div class="rating-desc">Anti-tempo kit and Rewinding Remains provide top-tier value in campaign push; formation disruption and cooldown manipulation compound across multi-stage fights</div>
            </div>
