            <p>Meret is a <strong>Legendary Support</strong> of the <strong>Diamonds faction</strong> built around a single layered system: the <span class="highlight">Note mechanic</span>. She is not a healer in the traditional sense and not a main DPS. Her role is <em>Tempo Enabler and Anti-Burst Stabilizer</em> - she shields the frontline, buffs the carry, regenerates her own Energy, distributes incoming damage across Note-bearers, and provides death immunity through her Relic.</p>
            <p>Her kit compresses tank protection, carry amplification, Energy management, emergency healing, and burst mitigation into a single hero slot. In higher-difficulty content, she is a core support in the Diamonds faction - Athena can substitute defensively but cannot replicate Meret's buff and tempo output.</p>
